<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 446 NZ cents per kg clean vs 451 at last week's sales, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean) were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 776 vs 777</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 510 vs 522</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 407 vs 411</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 384 vs 385</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
